WEBVTT

1
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:31,740
A few days ago, that guy from Shen Cheng was chatting with me.

2
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:34,740
If you say no now, it will be gone

3
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:39,230
Wrong number of people

4
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:41,460
If Zhang Hao and Shen Cheng both died

5
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:43,660
The current number of survivors should be 26

6
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:44,660
Not 27

7
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:49,370
My brother has grilled meat for me before.

8
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:51,450
He is good at cooking

9
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:54,850
He does all the work at home. Don't cry.

10
00:00:54,850 --> 00:00:58,500
Is your brother dead or not?

11
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:04,520
It's not right that we saw him being dragged in with our own eyes.

12
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:06,410
Did you hear the broadcast?

13
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:09,380
The radio said there were 27 people left
